  "docTitle": "Notification System - SDE Prep Dojo",
  "description": "Design a notification system (push, SMS, email, in-app) from a school-announcement story to SDE-2 answers: priorities so OTPs never wait behind campaigns, Kafka topics per channel, dedupe, retries and DLQ, provider failover, and autoscaling workers on Kubernetes.",
  "hero": {
