    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">30 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">Flipkart</span><span class=\"chip company\">Swiggy</span><span class=\"chip company\">Atlassian</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Notification System</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">\"Your OTP is 482913\", \"Your order has shipped\", \"Big Billion Days starts now!\" One platform sends all of them over push, SMS, email and in-app. After this page you can design it end to end, explain why an OTP must never wait behind 100 million promo messages, and show exactly where Kafka, retries, dedupe and a dead-letter queue fit.</p>\n      "
  },
